WEBVTT

00:00.070 --> 00:02.600
Watching a video in another language? Live subtitles, as it plays.

00:06.670 --> 00:08.630
60 languages. Speak, and it translates.

00:09.800 --> 00:12.170
47 voices. It reads the translation aloud.

00:12.370 --> 00:15.130
[read aloud] No waiting for the sentence to end — the subtitles keep up with you.

00:15.170 --> 00:17.370
The overlay stays on top, so you can follow any meeting.

00:17.500 --> 00:20.300
Meetings, videos, recordings — it translates them all.

00:20.530 --> 00:22.500
Four APIs. Switch any time.

00:23.300 --> 00:25.070
Light or dark, following your system.

00:26.630 --> 00:29.670
ReaLingo. Free, open source, on all three platforms.
